name pgfkeyx
category Package
revision 26093
shortdesc Extended and more robust version of pgfkeys
relocated 1
longdesc The package extends and improves the robustness of the pgfkeys
longdesc package. In particular, it can deal with active comma, equality
longdesc sign, and slash in key parsing. The difficulty with active
longdesc characters has long been a problem with the pgfkeys package.
longdesc The package also introduces handlers beyond those that pgfkeys
longdesc can offer.
